# ── Lean / Lake build artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────
/.lake/
build/
*.olean
*.ilean
*.trace
*.hash

# ── Papers ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# arXiv sources of the papers the tree cites, each in papers/arXiv-<id>/ at
# the version cited; `./run.py papers` fetches the missing ones.  No
# trailing slash: in a worktree it is a link to the root's.
/papers

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.egg-info/
dist/
.ruff_cache/
/optimizers/profiles/

# ── Editors / OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# ── discrtree ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The tool's own state: the config, the index, the JSONL dumps and the
# fetched corpora.  Local to the machine, and reproducible with
# `dt init && dt fetch && dt dump && dt index`.
/.discrtree/
/discrtree.toml
/.claude/skills/discrtree/

# ── Agents ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The agent-kanban board and the agents' worktrees: local to the machine
# (AGENTS.md, Board).
/.kanban/
/.claude/worktrees/

# ── Experiments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Run outputs, compile caches and generated datasets.  No trailing slash on
# `runs`: in a worktree it is a link to the root's.  The reference runs
# under experiments/archive/ are tracked, so `runs` is not ignored everywhere.
/experiments/*/runs
/experiments/archive/synthetic_trainers/runs/
/experiments/runs
/experiments/*/data
/python/runs
/python/results/
# The GPTMini benchmark project moved to legacy/gpt_mini (2c81c3f0); what is
# left here is its caches and a link to its runs.
/python/src/infrastructure/
